  "details": "As the title says phys Bone stops working if ctrl + z is used during playmode to set a value back. Its very easy to replicate, all values to max, set all values to zero, and ctrl + z back till all values are back to max and it will act like the values are at are at max even tho they arent.\nIts easy to fix, remember the value that its suppose to be, drag the slider to zero or max, and then manually fill in the value. Really weird glitch. \nIt also sometimes just stops working completely and refuses to respond to any setting changes and i think thats related to this.",
